The page follows the shape of KDE's System Settings modules (KCMUtils, KConfig,
Kirigami) and of KDE's own handling of the PrefersNonDefaultGPU key in desktop
entries (KService::runOnDiscreteGpu, KMenuEdit, KIO's ApplicationLauncherJob);
no code is copied from them. The variables that send a program to another GPU
are the ones switcheroo-control (Bastien Nocera) publishes for each GPU. The
power switches use power-profiles-daemon's D-Bus interface (Bastien Nocera and
contributors).

